# =========================================================
# IMPORTANT
#
# release/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# The project currently distributes installers directly
# through raw.githubusercontent.com instead of GitHub
# Releases, therefore the following files must be committed:
#
# release/update-manifest.json
# release/windows/AntiArchiveScanner-Setup.exe
# release/macos/AntiArchiveScanner.dmg
# =========================================================